Package: com.qcomtoolbox.gravityicons
Name: Gravity Icons
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Adds realistic physics-based gravity to your home screen icons. Tilt your device and watch icons fall, collide, and settle like real objects. Toggle on/off any time in Settings.
Maintainer: qcom-toolbox <contact@office-works.ch>
Author: qcom-toolbox <contact@office-works.ch>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
